  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Why this happens",
      "char_file": "시계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A resting heart rate",
        "under 60 bpm is",
        "called bradycardia",
        "",
        "Regular exercisers can",
        "have it naturally",
        "",
        "Sleep apnea, medication,",
        "and vagal overstimulation",
        "are the common causes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Sleep apnea",
      "char_file": "수면무호흡_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A collapsed airway during",
        "sleep drops your oxygen",
        "",
        "That triggers an overactive",
        "vagal response that pulls",
        "your heart rate down"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Here's how to help",
      "char_file": "양압기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Sleep on your side and",
        "manage your weight",
        "",
        "Ask your doctor about",
        "a sleep study if snoring",
        "is severe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Medication",
      "char_file": "아스피린_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Beta-blockers and calcium",
        "channel blockers are built",
        "to slow your heart down",
        "",
        "A dose that's too high",
        "can slow it more than intended"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Here's how to help",
      "char_file": "아스피린_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Never stop a prescription",
        "on your own",
        "",
        "Tell your doctor if your",
        "pulse drops noticeably"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Vagal overstimulation",
      "char_file": "변기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Straining, cold water on",
        "your face, or standing still",
        "for a long time",
        "",
        "can trigger a strong vagal",
        "reflex that drops your",
        "heart rate suddenly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Here's how to help",
      "char_file": "물컵_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Get enough fiber and water",
        "",
        "If you must stand still,",
        "shift your weight or",
        "flex your calves"
      ]
    }
  ],
  "closing": {
    "headline": [
      [
        "Manage sleep apnea, check in on medication,",
        "and ease off vagal-triggering habits"
      ],
      [
        "and your pulse",
        "stabilizes"
      ]
